calamares-settings-veltos (1.1.0~dev3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Side bar: the website link opens on one press and says "Opening…"
    while the browser starts.
  * "If you forget your password" page (notesqml@recovery, after the
    account): a password hint and an optional password reset USB, with a
    plain note that without one a forgotten password can't be reset.
  * password-recovery job: writes the hint (AccountsService) and makes
    the drive with veltos-auth; the last page says whether it worked.
  * install-veltos' helper: GET /drives (USB drives for the page) and
    POST /choices (the page's choices for the job; Calamares' QML
    cannot write its global storage).

